REYNARD SCREEN 1
NAME DEMO
SIZE 24,80
ITEM SAY 2,2 SCHEME 1 "Name:"
ITEM GET 2,8 VAR NAME SAY "Name:" SIZE 1,16 PICTURE "@K XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX" VALID name <> "" SCHEME 1
ITEM SAY 3,2 SCHEME 1 "Age:"
ITEM GET 3,8 VAR AGE SIZE 1,3 PICTURE "999" RANGE 0,120 DEFAULT 0 SCHEME 1
ITEM BOX 1,1 TO 5,30 SCHEME 1
ITEM BUTTON 7,2 PROMPT "OK" VAR BTN SCHEME 1
END
